 Hardware Setup

Wire the HW-504 joystick module to your Arduino Uno as shown below:

| HW-504 Pin | Arduino Pin | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| GND | GND | Ground |
| +5V | 5V | 5V Power |
| VRx | A0 | X-Axis Input |
| VRy | A1 | Y-Axis Input |
| SW | D2 | Push Button |

